{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_02_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_02","title":"生命運河","storyCode":"HE-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"4e8e258176dc1a50e40e3ab80b52f45154b06e1a293623bd5a372b1c8c80dd45","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"杰拉爾德與舊友告別。布道的鐘聲已被敲響，不祥的銃聲恰在此時響起。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德，你是打算和我一起去敲鐘嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。之前有一回我托你幫忙敲鐘，你不樂意，最後還是使喚萊蒙德那小夥子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是有這麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你不喜歡鐘聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"談不上喜歡不喜歡，都這麼多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年了，你還是沒能習慣它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我，鐘聲沒給我留下過什麼好的記憶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克萊芒，你還記得愛琳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛琳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會忘？當初如果不是你和愛琳救了我，我早就被那群強盜丟進峽谷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是她要救你，我本打算多一事不如少一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話你別當我的面說啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，抱歉抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚我們在外頭紮營，收穫不算很多，但處理起來也不輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德給他的獵物放血，我把火生起來。看著那點火苗逐漸向上躥，也不知道怎麼了，我忽然想起愛琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實很久沒有想到過她了。但直到我想起，我才意識到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至記不清她的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她這個人，在我們這群人中間算是個怪胎。當初她和我說，看見修道院遍地的鮮花，聽見這裡的鐘響，能讓她心情平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在沒有那麼多花可以看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛琳是真的喜歡這裡的鐘聲。一直到她走的那天，還堅持等到鐘聲響起，才合眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你不喜歡鐘聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或許只是害怕。我怕它再帶來壞消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那時候我們有足夠的藥，或許她受的傷就不會惡化，也不會就這麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有如果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......願她能獲得救贖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉爾德，你們真的決定要走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到會這麼急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來該提前和你說一聲，只是一直沒找到機會開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德和福爾圖娜他們恐怕要難受一陣子了，他們幾個孩子一向關係好，這次一定很不好受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德還太年輕。他來到這裡時還太小，記不住太多事。他還沒能理解身為薩卡茲究竟是怎麼一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他總會瞭解，總要習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這就是薩卡茲的宿命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宿命不是什麼好詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你說得有道理，但我找不到別的詞來形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，我該去看看愛琳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們就不是一路了，不如就在這分開吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，杰拉爾德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我可以和你一起走，稍微繞一點路而已，不費什麼事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你看，最近正好是花期，我們可以一起去摘點花送給愛琳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以和你們一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，克萊芒。你糊塗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該從這走。你該走上那邊的台階，往上走，那邊的風景會很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們還能看到這麼好的風景嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去敲鐘吧，克萊芒。別耽誤了時候。那裡才是你要去的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後要多保重，兄弟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在說什麼，菲娜，這和蕾繆安小姐沒關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說謊！除了那個拉特蘭人，這裡還有誰能幫你修好你的守護銃？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會這麼想？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有沒有說謊，難道你分不出來？菲娜，難道你不明白我現在的感受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我多希望我真的能明白，但是小福，我開始搞不懂了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光環告訴我你是真誠的，你的痛苦不比我少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果這是真的，為什麼你還能有心情做什麼格子餅，你還能毫無芥蒂地與那些拉特蘭來的人為伍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小福，我真的搞不懂了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為......我希望大家都能過上好日子，菲娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們其實沒得選，是不是？雖然斯特凡諾爺爺不說，大家也都不和我們談論，但我其實心裡清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭會讓我們回去，我以前偷偷聽到大人們說過，我們的修道院其實是很厲害的建築，拉特蘭一定會想要我們回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道杰拉爾德叔叔他們，可能、可能不能和我們一起走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想再努力一下！如果能讓拉特蘭的人明白，杰拉爾德叔叔他們都是很好很好的人，或許就能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許能什麼？或許他們能同意，讓大家一起去拉特蘭生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算是明白了......這就是你總願意和那個蕾繆安說話的原因？你覺得自己在替其他人充當說客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你求她了嗎？為了能讓萊蒙德他們不被拋下，你覺得我們必須要懇求，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想勸他們改變主意，但你成功了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我還在努力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會成功的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是你的一廂情願，小福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我和萊蒙德哪裡不同？和卡洛琳哪裡不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萊蒙德比我能幹多了，卡洛琳姐也比我更聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你自己也清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們區分我們，他們承認我們是同胞，卻同時貶低我們真正的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能忍受這些。我寧願不去這樣的拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......菲娜，我們不是說好了，以後一定會走出這片荒野，走到拉特蘭去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要過不會餓肚子，不會受凍，到處都能見到鮮花，而不是只能看到單調荒原的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小福，那都是小孩子的幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得那已經只是幻想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是沒有你那麼樂觀。我只知道，自從那些拉特蘭人出現，修道院裡的氣氛越來越奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我們的日子是過得很難，但我從來不討厭這樣的日子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡聽斯特凡諾爺爺每周的布道，也喜歡杰拉爾德叔叔說的那些過去的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的時候吃不飽，卡洛琳會偷偷給我們多塞兩根肉乾，妮娜嬸嬸會給萊蒙德多加一勺最稠的菜粥，我們就在一起分著把它們吃完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這樣很好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人都說拉特蘭好，可我卻只看到那些人把我們原本的生活攪得一團糟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是菲娜，你不能把這些都怪到蕾繆安小姐頭上，這是遷怒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遷怒？或許是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是小福，你知道大家私下裡在說什麼嗎？你有留意到最近一段時間，杰拉爾德叔叔他們來的次數越來越少嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道在你忙著去給那位蕾繆安小姐送飯，在你忙著做什麼該死的格子餅的時候，卡洛琳他們......他們吃的都是些什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？等等，菲娜，你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡洛琳姐他們怎麼了？我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我不好，這怪不了你。畢竟我如果不是親眼看到，也想不到情況會壞到這個地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小福，如果我們的光環，讓你有半點感受到我現在的心情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就把你的守護銃給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜？你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不需要對著這種東西祈禱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的狀態不對，菲娜......這太危險了，我、我不能給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不能？你之前不是還說可以和我一起分享嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說過，但、但這不是一回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說你搞不懂我，這話該我來說才對......你到底怎麼了，你清醒一點，菲娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒有這麼清醒過，什麼祈禱，什麼薩科塔獨有的聯繫，我受夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要這種特殊！我只想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜，你別這樣——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......啊，啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德爾菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想......大家能，一直在一起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜？你怎麼了，你別嚇我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，總算找到你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，還順利嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，單獨行動需要提前告知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼死板嘛，我也是為了儘快完成任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，一個好消息，我找到蕾繆安了，她就在修道院內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有個壞消息——她沒打算過來和我們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙總有自己的想法，我勸不動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你別朝我皺眉，有本事你自己去抓她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？好什麼......等會，你是在開玩笑吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，教你一個公證所內部小知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼玩意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科不會開玩笑。他沒這個功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會親自找到她，並確認她的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼，難道你覺得我會說謊騙你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法確保你一定會說實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在可算是知道你為什麼上了教皇廳那麼多姑娘的黑名單了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，先不說這個。你們那邊怎麼樣......你們已經和這裡的人說上話了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊先生......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位也是你們的同伴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯，我們都是同事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的修道院居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......年輕的薩科塔，你們還想問什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的修道院居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們這什麼都沒有，什麼都沒有啦......沒啥好說的，你們也不該來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妮娜嬸嬸！怎麼能這麼說，本來也是我們先聯繫的拉特蘭......當初您不是也不反對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反對......我沒有反對嗎？唉，我就該告訴斯特凡諾，讓他再別指望拉特蘭啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，對，朱利安，把他們趕出去吧！我們不該讓拉特蘭人來，我們不需要拉特蘭人的幫助，就該現在把他們趕出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朱利安","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妮娜嬸嬸！你冷靜一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朱利安","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底怎麼了，剛剛你不是還說要招待幾位客人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你們好像需要單獨聊聊......有什麼我幫得上忙的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朱利安","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉！妮娜嬸嬸只是有點激動......呃，幫忙就不必了，我先帶她去休息，有事的話可以之後再聊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！好好休息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有點奇怪啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你們這邊好像不太順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本還好好的，也不知道是怎麼了，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，是你要來找這裡的居民問話的，你看出什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女士的情緒並不穩定，在對話途中改變想法的例子不少見，但當事人完全遺忘之前的對話，並態度驟變，這並非常見情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我對此有一定猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅作為我的個人推測，在可能性上升到足以被討論前，我會保持緘默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了發現這裡的居民有點神經錯亂之外，你們總該還有些其他收穫吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，男士們。到了該交流的時候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說......那位主教閣下，是為了住在這裡的薩卡茲，才給我們增加了這麼多工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該提過可以接他們回拉特蘭吧？他這是為了薩卡茲，硬是把這裡的所有人留下來忍凍挨餓？為了薩卡茲，扣押拉特蘭特使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......認真的？前頭剛走一個大逆不道的安多恩，現在又來一位仁慈博愛的主教閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*口哨聲*酷哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也不太在乎什麼世仇，不過他這樣是不是腦子壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就怪不得連蕾繆安都不能答應這種要求了......薩卡茲才在倫蒂尼姆大鬧一場，那幾個維多利亞大公爵可都恨得牙癢癢呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個時間點，萬一和薩卡茲牽扯不清這事傳出去，教宗閣下的萬國聯合計劃就完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來挺嚴重的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，我記得蕾繆安和奧倫的任務是給這裡提供支援，並將這座修道院收回拉特蘭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合理的判斷，畢竟是能作為戰堡使用的建築，背景也很特殊，還是很有用處的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是當我們想和伊比利亞恢復聯繫的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少目前看來，沒有在這大動干戈的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，費德里科，你剛剛是不是認出那個薩卡茲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個的對話就像“晚上吃什麼？”“吃飯。”一樣無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，想要你多說一個字得付多少錢？你開個價，我回去找教宗閣下報銷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有考慮過這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放過費德里科吧。對了，既然蕾繆安沒什麼問題，那......奧倫呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙一早就跑了，蕾繆安也不知道他的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他那個人最會自保，要我說......他現在說不定在哪打他的算盤呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪裡來的鐘聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是通知布道將要開始的鐘聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要去參加嗎？趁布道的時候修道院內沒人，是不是該去找找奧倫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我會參加布道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，出人意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要確認修道院的整體狀況，以便判斷這裡的系統在目前的狀況下是否仍能夠穩定運作，以及是否需要外力介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參加一場聚集大量居民的布道會是一個很好的觀察機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要這麼說的話確實也是，嗯，不過我還以為你會優先處理更加明確的問題，就比如奧倫......你是不是在擔心什麼，費德里科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你多慮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只會以我認為合理的方式履行我的職責。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？鐘聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......還不到主教閣下平常布道的日子，怎麼這時候敲鐘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，克萊芒！你來得正好，這是出了什麼事啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘是主教閣下吩咐敲的，閣下今天臨時決定要布道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家快去禮拜堂吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"這......是該去的，可我們手上的活還沒幹完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼忽然要布道了？是不是和那些拉特蘭來的人有關？他們是不是......呃，是不是來找我們麻煩的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼會這麼問......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒什麼，你就說是不是吧......哎，你說，是不是因為杰拉爾德他們在，所以人家不同意我們去拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是誰這麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都瞎猜呢。薩卡茲和薩科塔不是關係差嗎，大家就猜，要不是因為這個，說不定現在我們已經到拉特蘭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，現在說這些沒意思，就是不知道主教閣下是怎麼想的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒，我剛剛說的你就當沒聽過，大夥也沒怪誰，這事也怪不了誰，就是......天氣冷了，這個冬天不好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"大夥都想著要是真能去拉特蘭，那、那裡應該能找到活幹，有吃有穿吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"要是拉特蘭附近有林子就好了，至少能多撿點樹枝回來生火，讓年紀小點的孩子冬天暖和些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你說得對，至少讓孩子們暖和些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們到了拉特蘭，真的就會有好日子嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"應該吧......要不然我們還能上哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別太擔心了，克萊芒......神會保佑我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音......這又是怎麼了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這聲音是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（銃聲？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊芒已經敲響鐘聲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來......我該準備最後的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜，孩子，是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一向很準時......其他人還沒到，請先坐下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有些準備要做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福爾圖娜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......斯特凡諾......爺爺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幫幫我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"染血的女孩一步一步走向愕然的老人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"濛濛的光終於照亮女孩的臉，讓人看清那面龐上的點點血跡，以及從飽滿的額頭上鑽出的黑色犄角。\n女孩身前是蒙著光的持銃聖徒像，身後卻留下一條抹不去的血色之路。\n薩科塔的血滴落在禮拜堂的地板上，發出沉悶的碎裂聲，驚人夢醒，震耳欲聾。\n用於祈禱的守護銃終於從緊握它的那隻手中滑落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜、菲娜她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子，別哭，德爾菲娜她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她受傷了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福爾圖娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我、是我弄傷了她......斯特凡諾爺爺，救救菲娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教閣下！您沒事吧？發生了什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......福爾圖娜？你怎麼在這......你身上這是......血......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂，真的假的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這可不是鬧著玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們......這到底是怎麼一回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼福爾圖娜她會、她會長出這樣黑色的角？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"執行者在其他人的注視下步入禮拜堂。\n墮天使仍在悲泣，斯特凡諾卻不得不抬頭仰視來者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的光環反應出現波動，頭顱前頂部生角，這是非常明確的墮天表現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她違反了戒律。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
